notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-17T05:14:42.877Z",codex,"Measured gap on 2026-08-17: coverageGate.sources is the repository root, but the gate prunes scripts via DEFAULT_SKIP_DIRS. The reported required source set therefore contains only index.ts while three executable tooling files remain outside measurement; prepare-merge-driver.mjs also violates the TypeScript-only fleet rule. This item remains open and must not be represented as completed by the exact index.ts result."
  "2026-08-21T08:31:10.804Z",codex,"Re-measured on 2026-08-21 while adding packed acceptance: the gate reports exactly one source file (index.ts) at 100/100/100,while scripts/coverage-gate.ts,scripts/docstring-gate.ts,and new scripts/accept-packed.ts remain pruned; scripts/prepare-merge-driver.mjs remains executable JavaScript. A bounded rg audit found 62 test lines containing explicit any casts or annotations,and package scripts contain no ESLint or jscpd gate. This remains an independent high-priority blocker; the canonical-reader tranche must not claim all-source coverage or repo-wide no-any compliance."
